            <note corresp="#d760-f2" n="2" xml:id="d760-f2-content">
                <p>In telegram Tedul 204 to Geneva, June 16, drafted by the Secretary of State, the
                    Secretary said “Agree” with reference to Dulte 186. (396.1 GE/6–1654)</p>
            </note>
